- Support Ark servers in expiry payout mode
  The wallet sends its owner mailbox in every request that makes a VTXO,
  credits a received VTXO only when the server reports it bound to its
  mailbox, and records the payout of an expired VTXO as pending, paid or
  forfeited. With other servers the wallet behaves as upstream.
  [#1](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/1)
  - `Wallet::expiry_payout` returns the payout of a VTXO, and
    `Wallet::payout_script` the payout output `tr(M)` to watch on-chain.
  - `WalletSeed::with_mailbox_keypair` uses a mailbox keypair of the app.
  - `Config::require_expiry_payouts` opens the wallet only with a server in
    expiry payout mode.
  - `Config::lightning_ark_address_hints` puts the Ark address of the
    wallet in its invoices, and pays such an invoice with an arkoor.
  - **BREAKING:** `BarkPersister` has the required methods
    `set_mailbox_key` and `set_vtxo_expiry_payout_state`.
